{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺中無祖師像。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恒持海眼經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得法上首巳，䁂請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是日大雨，至期忽晴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "康熙十九年二月，剃度弟子元、元一"}
